  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Shout. For 4...9...10 seconds, all allies within earshot gain 5...13...15 Health per second while moving and move 33% faster. \"Fall Back!\" ends on an ally affected by this shout when that ally successfully hits with an attack.",
      "zhTW": "持續4～10秒，在音量所及範圍內的盟友移動速度增加33%且移動時每秒獲得5～15體力。而當盟友成功擊中目標時，此戰嚎對其的影響終止。"
    },
